        "921": {"synopsis":"Arctangent of the top number, in radians (byte $A2).\n1. A negative x is negated (C = 1 records it).\n2. x > 1 is replaced by 1/x (B = 2).\n3. x > TAN 15 degrees is replaced by (x*SQR 3 - 1)/(x + SQR 3), the tangent of the angle\n   less 30 degrees (B + 1); x*SQR 3 - 1 is formed as (SQR 3 - 1)x - 0.5 - 0.5 + x.\n4. With r the reduced x and R1 = r*r: ATN r = r + r*(c14*R1*R1 + c13*R1)/(R1*R1 + c16*R1 +\n   c15), constants $13-$16.\n5. The steps are undone: negated for B >= 2, then pi/6 added for B = 1, pi/2 for B = 2, pi/3\n   for B = 3; negated again for C = 1.\nChanges: A, BC, DE, HL; R1."},
        "922": {"comment":"Convert x to float form"},
        "923": {"comment":"NZ when x is negative"},
        "925": {"comment":"B = reductions, C = negative flag"},
        "928": {"comment":"Not negative"},
        "930": {"comment":"C = 1: x was negative"},
        "933": {"comment":"Make x positive"},
        "936": {"synopsis":"x >= 0: R1 = x; x > 1 is turned into 1/x."},
        "938": {"comment":"R1 = x (popped)"},
        "939": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "940": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "941": {"comment":"Constant 1: 1"},
        "942": {"comment":"Compare x with 1"},
        "944": {"comment":"x < 1"},
        "947": {"comment":"x = 1"},
        "950": {"comment":"B = 2: 1/x taken"},
        "954": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "955": {"comment":"FP_RECIPROCAL: 1/x"},
        "956": {"comment":"R1 = 1/x"},
        "958": {"synopsis":"Above TAN 15 degrees the argument is turned by 30 degrees."},
        "959": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "960": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "961": {"comment":"Constant $17: TAN 15 degrees"},
        "962": {"comment":"Compare r with it"},
        "964": {"comment":"Below"},
        "967": {"comment":"Equal"},
        "970": {"comment":"B + 1: 30 degrees taken off"},
        "973": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "974": {"comment":"Constant $19: SQR 3 - 1"},
        "975": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "976": {"comment":"(SQR 3 - 1)r"},
        "977": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "978": {"comment":"Constant 0: 0.5"},
        "979": {"comment":"Subtract"},
        "980": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "981": {"comment":"Constant 0: 0.5"},
        "982": {"comment":"Subtract: (SQR 3 - 1)r - 1"},
        "983": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "984": {"comment":"Add: r*SQR 3 - 1"},
        "985": {"comment":"Push constant n"},
        "986": {"comment":"Constant $18: SQR 3"},
        "987": {"comment":"Push R1"},
        "988": {"comment":"Add: r + SQR 3"},
        "989": {"comment":"Divide"},
        "990": {"comment":"R1 = the turned r"},
        "992": {"synopsis":"Evaluates the rational approximation on r (stack r, r; R1 = r*r)."},
        "993": {"comment":"Push R1: r"},
        "994": {"comment":"Copy r"},
        "995": {"comment":"Copy r"},
        "996": {"comment":"Copy r"},
