        "2097": {"synopsis":"JOY function (keyword entry): reads \"( n )\", n = 0 the internal joystick, 1 or 2 an external\none (else error 1000), reads it with EXOS 11 special function 9 (@@JOY) on channel $69 and\npushes the result: bit 0 right, 1 left, 2 down, 3 up, 4 fire."},
