        "2215": {"synopsis":"Common logarithm of the top number (call byte $AA). Error 3004 \"Invalid argument to LOG\"\nwhen it is 0 or negative.\n1. x = m * 10^k with m = 0.d.ddd (R1's exponent byte set to $3F); m below sqrt(0.1) is\n   multiplied by 10 and k lowered.\n2. z = (m - 1)/(m + 1); log10 m = z * (c20 + P/Q), P and Q polynomials in z^2 (constants\n   $1A-$1F, c20 = 2/ln 10).\n3. Adds k (the old exponent byte - $3F)."},
        "2216": {"comment":"x zero? (Z = yes)"},
        "2218": {"comment":"Zero: error 3004, Invalid argument to LOG"},
        "2222": {"comment":"Negative? (NZ = yes)"},
