        "2535": {"synopsis":"SPEEK function (keyword entry): reads \"( segment, address )\" (segment 0-255, else error\n1000), pages the segment into page 1 for a moment and pushes the byte at the address's\noffset in it (bits 0-13)."},
        "2536": {"comment":"Expect ( and the segment"},
        "2537": {"comment":"HL = the segment"},
