        "2950": {"synopsis":"Sine of the top number, in radians.\n1. Error 1000 when the absolute value is not below 57.2957795131.\n2. Brings x into [-pi/2, pi/2] by steps of pi, flipping the result's sign at each step.\n3. Computes x + x*x^2*P(x^2), P a polynomial in x^2 with constants $0E-$12.\nChanges: R1."},
        "2951": {"comment":"Into float form"},
        "2952": {"comment":"Duplicate x"},
        "2953": {"comment":"Pop it into R1"},
        "2954": {"comment":"Absolute value"},
